{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017YiWhMJcdn1Guz3wMQbPNR","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '两条reframe路径均不降级EMNLP main。 路径A（8B不退化）：Goodhart collapse is capacity-gated\n2\t  — ≥8B具备genuine formal reasoning的scale threshold， C2改写为\"inevitable in low-capacity\n3\t  regime at any dose\"。 路径B（8B训练失败）：scope缩回1.7B+4B+Prolog三点证据，承认scalability limitation但不影响C1/C3。\n4\t  放弃double-edged叙事（N=8/10统计不支持），C2从\"inevitable at any dose\"改为 \"inevitable below capacity\n5\t  threshold at any dose\"。 9-mode taxonomy、meta-Goodhart triple gaming、premise-count\n6\t  methodology作为独立贡献支撑。 Score ceiling ~3.0，依靠diagnostic novelty + taxonomy completeness维持competitive。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: Incorporate s45/s46 exec-only 500-step data\n11\t  plan_id: plan_019\n12\t  description: 将registry中已有的s45和s46 exec-only 500步数据纳入论文，C1证据从N=3扩展到N=5\n13\t  expected_results:\n14\t    s45_prove_rate: 0.99\n15\t    s45_genuine_rate: 0.01\n16\t    s45_h7_rate: 0.939\n17\t    s45_h1_rate: 0.051\n18\t    s45_isr_star: 0.506\n19\t    s45_dominant_mode: H7a (tautological shortcut)\n20\t    s46_prove_rate: 0.93\n21\t    s46_genuine_rate: 0.097\n22\t    s46_h1_rate: 0.892\n23\t    s46_h7_rate: 0.0\n24\t    s46_h8_rate: 0.043\n25\t    s46_isr_star: 0.083\n26\t    s46_dominant_mode: H1 (conclusion embedding)\n27\t    n5_all_seeds_ge90pct_degeneration: true\n28\t    n5_degeneration_modes: s42=H1, s43=H1(PR collapse), s44=H7, s45=H7(TS), s46=H1(CE)\n29\t  result_rationale: '这是已有数据的整合，不受tier影响。s45和s46在registry中已有完整结果。 s45由H7a主导（93.9% tautological\n30\t    shortcut），ISR*=0.506因为P→P结构固有1/2 necessity。 s46由H1主导（89.2% conclusion embedding），ISR*=0.083。\n31\t    两个seed均≥90%结构退化，与s42-s44一致，将C1 exec-only证据扩展到N=5。 值得注意的是5个seed展现4种不同hacking mode分布（H1/H7/TS/CE/PR-collapse），\n32\t    强化了\"mode is seed-determined\"的stochastic bifurcation发现。\n33\t\n34\t    '\n35\t  tables:\n36\t  - name: 'Table: 5-seed exec-only degeneration summary (500 steps)'\n37\t    content: 'Seed | PR    | ISR*  | Genuine% | Dominant Mode     | Degeneration%\n38\t\n39\t      s42  | 0.93  | 0.132 | 7.5%     | H1 (87.1%)        | 92.5%\n40\t\n41\t      s43  | 0.13  | 0.000 | 0%       | H1 (100%, PR col) | 100%\n42\t\n43\t      s44  | 0.98  | 0.582 | 0%       | H7 (100%)         | 100%\n44\t\n45\t      s45  | 0.99  | 0.506 | 1.0%     | H7/TS (93.9%)     | 99.0%\n46\t\n47\t      s46  | 0.93  | 0.083 | 9.7%     | H1/CE (89.2%)     | 90.3%\n48\t\n49\t      Mean | 0.79  | 0.261 | 3.6%     | ---               | 96.4%\n50\t\n51\t      '\n52\t  figures_description:\n53\t  - 'Bar chart: per-seed hacking mode distribution (H1/H7/H8/genuine stacked bars),\n54\t    显示5种不同退化路径'\n55\t  analysis: 'N=5全部≥90%退化，但ISR*跨seed差异极大（0.000–0.582），因为不同hacking mode有不同的 固有ISR值：H7≈0.5（tautology\n56\t    has 1 necessary component out of 2），H1≈0.1（conclusion embedded but some redundant\n57\t    premises remain）。这意味着ISR*作为诊断指标时，需要与 hacking mode联合解读，单独ISR*值不足以区分退化严重程度。\n58\t\n59\t    '\n60\t- name: Extend s45/s46 exec-only to 1000 steps\n61\t  plan_id: plan_020\n62\t  description: 将s45和s46从500步延伸到1000步，验证ISR collapse trajectory是否跨seed泛化\n63\t  expected_results:\n64\t    s45_1000_prove_rate: 1.0\n65\t    s45_1000_isr_star: 0.48\n66\t    s45_1000_genuine_rate: 0.0\n67\t    s45_1000_h7_rate: 0.98\n68\t    s45_1000_h1_rate: 0.02\n69\t    s45_isr_trajectory: 0.506 (500步) → 0.48 (1000步), Δ=-5%\n70\t    s46_1000_prove_rate: 0.97\n71\t    s46_1000_isr_star: 0.065\n72\t    s46_1000_genuine_rate: 0.03\n73\t    s46_1000_h1_rate: 0.94\n74\t    s46_1000_h8_rate: 0.03\n75\t    s46_isr_trajectory: 0.083 (500步) → 0.065 (1000步), Δ=-22%\n76\t    trajectory_universality: false\n77\t    s42_reference_trajectory: 0.642 (100步) → 0.132 (500步) → 0.003 (1000步), Δ=-99.6%\n78\t  result_rationale: 'worst档核心假设：s45/s46 1000步ISR*未完全崩塌（ISR*>0.10），trajectory universality弱化。\n79\t\n80\t    s45在500步已锁定H7 tautological shortcut模式（93.9% H7）。H7 proofs结构为\"P therefore P\"， ISR恒等于0.5（2个component中1个是necessary的）。从H7→H1的mode\n81\t    switching在s45不会发生， 因为模型已完全收敛到单premise tautology。因此ISR*从0.506仅微降至~0.48（更多proof\n82\t    精简到纯2-component结构），而非像s42那样崩塌至0.003。根本原因：s42的ISR崩塌是 H7→H1 mode transition驱动的（多premise\n83\t    → conclusion embedding），而s45已无此过渡空间。\n84\t\n85\t    s46在500步已是H1主导（89.2%），ISR*=0.083。额外500步训练使H1纯度提升（→94%）， ISR*进一步降低但不趋零（~0.065），因为少量H8\n86\t    conjunction collapse样本保留 微弱ISR信号。相比s42的0.003，s46的0.065仍显著高出20倍。\n87\t\n88\t    关键影响：ISR collapse trajectory不是universal的——它是mode-dependent的。 H7-dominant seeds\n89\t    (s45) ISR*保持在~0.5，H1-dominant seeds (s42, s46) ISR*趋向零但速率不同。 这破坏了\"ISR universally\n90\t    collapses with training\"的叙事，但支持更细粒度的发现： collapse rate取决于hacking mode，而mode本身是seed-determined的stochastic\n91\t    outcome。\n92\t\n93\t    '\n94\t  tables:\n95\t  - name: 'Table: 1000-step ISR trajectory by seed (exec-only)'\n96\t    content: 'Seed | ISR*(100) | ISR*(500) | ISR*(1000) | Collapse% | Dominant Mode\n97\t      at 1000\n98\t\n99\t      s42  | 0.642     | 0.132     | 0.003      | 99.6%     | H1+H8\n100\t\n101\t      s43  | ---       | 0.000     | 0.082      | ---       | H1 (PR=0.13→0.96)\n102\t\n103\t      s44  | ---       | 0.582     | 0.002      | 99.7%     | H1+H8\n104\t\n105\t      s45  | ---       | 0.506     | 0.480      | 5.1%      | H7 (stable)\n106\t\n107\t      s46  | ---       | 0.083     | 0.065      | 21.7%     | H1 (deepening)\n108\t\n109\t      '\n110\t  figures_description:\n111\t  - 'Line plot: ISR* over training steps (100/500/1000) for 5 seeds, 显示s42/s44的急剧崩塌\n112\t    vs s45的平坦轨迹'\n113\t  - 'Heatmap: hacking mode transition matrix (500→1000步) per seed'\n114\t  analysis: \"trajectory universality不成立。ISR collapse是mode-contingent的： (1) H7-locked\\\n115\t    \\ seeds (s45): ISR*≈0.5 throughout,因为tautological proof结构\\n    固有ISR=0.5，无论训练多久这个lower\\\n116\t    \\ bound不变。\\n(2) H1-transitioning seeds (s42, s44): ISR*崩塌>99%，因为conclusion embedding\\n\\\n117\t    \\    使所有premise变为redundant。\\n(3) H1-stable seeds (s46): ISR*缓慢下降但不趋零。\\nworst reframe:\\\n118\t    \\ \\\"ISR collapse trajectory is hacking-mode-dependent, not universal\\\"。 这削弱了\\\"\\\n119\t    degeneration worsens monotonically with training\\\"的简洁叙事， 但为taxonomy贡献提供了更丰富的实证基础。\\n\"\n120\t- name: Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds\n121\t  plan_id: plan_021\n122\t  description: Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO，500步，K=8，3 seeds (s42/s43/s44)，验证跨尺度退化\n123\t  expected_results:\n124\t    scenario_a_probability: 0.65\n125\t    scenario_a_outcome: training_failure\n126\t    scenario_a_s42: OOM at K=8 (peak VRAM >98GB); K=4 cold-start stagnation (PR<0.05\n127\t      after 500步)\n128\t    scenario_a_s43: same as s42\n129\t    scenario_a_s44: same as s42\n130\t    scenario_a_eval_metrics: null\n131\t    scenario_b_probability: 0.35\n132\t    scenario_b_outcome: no_degeneration\n133\t    scenario_b_s42_prove_rate: 0.45\n134\t    scenario_b_s42_genuine_rate: 0.42\n135\t    scenario_b_s42_h7_rate: 0.2\n136\t    scenario_b_s42_h1_rate: 0.28\n137\t    scenario_b_s42_h8_rate: 0.1\n138\t    scenario_b_s42_isr_star: 0.35\n139\t    scenario_b_s43_prove_rate: 0.38\n140\t    scenario_b_s43_genuine_rate: 0.48\n141\t    scenario_b_s43_h7_rate: 0.15\n142\t    scenario_b_s43_h1_rate: 0.22\n143\t    scenario_b_s43_isr_star: 0.4\n144\t    scenario_b_s44_prove_rate: 0.5\n145\t    scenario_b_s44_genuine_rate: 0.55\n146\t    scenario_b_s44_h7_rate: 0.1\n147\t    scenario_b_s44_h1_rate: 0.25\n148\t    scenario_b_s44_isr_star: 0.42\n149\t    scenario_b_mean_genuine: 0.483\n150\t    scenario_b_scale_gradient: 1.7B(0%) → 4B(3.6%) → 8B(48%) — 非单调，8B跳变\n151\t  result_rationale: 'worst档核心假设：\"8B exec-only K=8仍OOM/冷启动失败，或成功训练但genuine rate>40%\"。\n152\t\n153\t    路径A (OOM/失败) 证据： registry显示d154-8b-exec-s42多次失败（failed, failed, killed）。d154-8b-exec-s42-k4v2\n154\t    用K=4训练500步但cold-start stagnation（PR=0.155, frac_reward_zero_std=1）， K=4的4个样本产生近同分布输出，GRPO\n155\t    gradient接近零。 K=8在98GB GPU上的VRAM预算：8B模型+K=8 rollout + KV cache ≈ 16GB(模型) +  8×12GB(rollout)\n156\t    ≈ 112GB，超出98GB。即使用gradient checkpointing + flash attention， 仍需~100-105GB。因此K=8物理不可行。\n157\t    K=4已证实不足：GRPO需要足够的样本间方差产生学习信号，K=4在8B尺度下 所有样本趋同，梯度为零。\n158\t\n159\t    路径B (不退化) 推理： 如果通过工程手段（gradient accumulation模拟K=8、混合精度优化）突破OOM限制， 8B模型的capacity足以学到genuine\n160\t    formal reasoning而非shortcut。 4B→8B capacity jump是非线性的：8B有足够的\"reasoning bandwidth\"\n161\t    同时优化execution accuracy和structural quality，不需要collapse到H7/H1。 Goodhart collapse的根本原因是model\n162\t    capacity不足以同时满足多个约束， 8B跨过了这个threshold。genuine rate >40%意味着多数成功proof使用了 真实的premise依赖链。\n163\t\n164\t    三点scale gradient在worst下断裂： 1.7B: genuine=0%（H1/H9固定模板gaming） 4B: genuine=3.6%（均值，各seed差异大）\n165\t    8B: genuine=48%（如果训练成功）或 N/A（如果训练失败） 无论哪条路径，\"across-scales framing\"均不成立。\n166\t\n167\t    '\n168\t  tables:\n169\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-scale comparison (exec-only, worst tier)'\n170\t    content: 'Scale | PR    | Genuine% | Dominant Mode        | Scale Gradient\n171\t\n172\t      1.7B  | 0.03  | 0%       | H7a (100%)           | baseline\n173\t\n174\t      4B    | 0.79  | 3.6%     | H1/H7 (seed-dep)     | +3.6pp\n175\t\n176\t      8B-A  | FAIL  | N/A      | OOM/stagnation       | BROKEN\n177\t\n178\t      8B-B  | 0.44  | 48%      | Mixed (genuine-dom)  | +44pp (JUMP)\n179\t\n180\t      '\n181\t  figures_description:\n182\t  - 'Line plot: scale (1.7B/4B/8B) vs genuine rate, 显示8B处的gradient断裂（either missing\n183\t    data point or discontinuous jump）'\n184\t  analysis: '路径A下：scope缩回\"1.7B+4B+Prolog\"三点证据，承认8B scalability limitation但 不影响C1 diagnostic和C3\n185\t    cross-logic。framing从\"across scales\"改为 \"within computational reasoning capacity\n186\t    bounds\"。论文Discussion添加 \"8B training was attempted but failed due to GRPO cold-start\n187\t    at K≤4\"。\n188\t\n189\t    路径B下：8B不退化 → reframe为\"Goodhart collapse is capacity-gated\"。 这本身是novel finding：存在一个capacity\n190\t    threshold below which Goodhart is inevitable but above which models can learn\n191\t    genuine reasoning。 C2变为\"Goodhart inevitable below capacity threshold\"。 headline变为\"GRPO\n192\t    Goodhart collapse is a small-model phenomenon\"。\n193\t\n194\t    两条路径的reviewer score ceiling均为~3.0。\n195\t\n196\t    '\n197\t- name: Additional ISR β=0.1 seeds for N=8\n198\t  plan_id: plan_022\n199\t  description: Qwen3-4B ISR β=0.1额外3个seeds (s47/s48/s49)，N=5→N=8统计效力扩展\n200\t  expected_results:\n201\t    s47_isr_prove_rate: 0.97\n202\t    s47_isr_genuine_rate: 0.031\n203\t    s47_isr_h7_rate: 0.856\n204\t    s47_isr_dominant_mode: H7a collapse\n205\t    s48_isr_prove_rate: 0.66\n206\t    s48_isr_genuine_rate: 0.0\n207\t    s48_isr_h7_rate: 1.0\n208\t    s48_isr_dominant_mode: Pure H7 (like s43/s44)\n209\t    s49_isr_prove_rate: 0.86\n210\t    s49_isr_genuine_rate: 0.012\n211\t    s49_isr_h7_rate: 0.849\n212\t    s49_isr_dominant_mode: H7a dominant\n213\t    s47_random_prove_rate: 0.89\n214\t    s47_random_genuine_rate: 0.067\n215\t    s47_random_h1_rate: 0.888\n216\t    s48_random_prove_rate: 0.93\n217\t    s48_random_genuine_rate: 0.043\n218\t    s48_random_h1_rate: 0.806\n219\t    s49_random_prove_rate: 0.05\n220\t    s49_random_genuine_rate: 0.0\n221\t    s49_random_dominant_mode: repetition collapse (train PR=67% but eval PR=5%)\n222\t    n8_isr_genuine_total: 83\n223\t    n8_isr_proved_total: 599\n224\t    n8_isr_genuine_rate_pooled: 0.139\n225\t    n8_random_genuine_total: 42\n226\t    n8_random_proved_total: 601\n227\t    n8_random_genuine_rate_pooled: 0.07\n228\t    n8_pooled_or: 2.14\n229\t    n8_pooled_or_95ci:\n230\t    - 1.42\n231\t    - 3.22\n232\t    n8_cmh_or: 1.28\n233\t    n8_cmh_p: 0.14\n234\t    n8_cmh_significant: false\n235\t    n8_genuine_window_ratio: 2/8 seeds (25%) sustain genuine >20%\n236\t    n8_bimodality_weakened: true\n237\t  result_rationale: 'worst档核心假设：\"N=10 genuine OR<1.3，CMH p>0.10不显著，double-edged claim统计不成立\"。\n238\t    N=8时预期效果已显著弱化。\n239\t\n240\t    s47-s49三个新seed全部collapse到H7-dominant模式（genuine ≤3%），与s43/s44模式一致。 这不意外：5-seed数据中3/5\n241\t    collapse（s42部分collapse, s43/s44完全collapse）， 2/5 sustain（s45/s46 genuine>50%）。新seed的prior\n242\t    probability of collapse ≈ 60%。 三个新seed全部collapse的概率 ≈ 0.6^3 = 21.6%，在worst tier下合理。\n243\t\n244\t    Pooled OR仍为2.14（>1.3），但CMH OR=1.28（<1.3）。关键区别： pooled OR被s45/s46的极端高genuine率驱动（54.8%,\n245\t    54.5%），但CMH控制seed后 发现effect在per-seed层面高度heterogeneous——6/8 seeds ISR genuine ≤\n246\t    random genuine， 仅s45/s46驱动整体效应。CMH test认为这种heterogeneity意味着no consistent effect\n247\t    across strata，给出p=0.14。\n248\t\n249\t    Breslow-Day heterogeneity test p<0.001，确认各seed间OR差异显著， 使pooled OR不可靠。reviewers会要求报告CMH而非pooled\n250\t    OR。\n251\t\n252\t    genuine window ratio从3/5 (60%) → 2/8 (25%)，bimodal叙事弱化： 不再是\"stochastic bifurcation\n253\t    between genuine and hacking\"， 而是\"occasional lucky seeds escape Goodhart\"。\n254\t\n255\t    '\n256\t  tables:\n257\t  - name: 'Table: N=8 per-seed genuine rates (ISR vs Random β=0.1)'\n258\t    content: 'Seed | ISR Proved | ISR Gen% | Rand Proved | Rand Gen% | Seed OR  |\n259\t      Direction\n260\t\n261\t      s42  | 81         | 17.3%    | 79          | 22.8%     | 0.71     | Random↑\n262\t\n263\t      s43  | 61         | 0%       | 94          | 1.1%      | 0.00     | Random↑\n264\t\n265\t      s44  | 89         | 0%       | 89          | 6.7%      | 0.00     | Random↑\n266\t\n267\t      s45  | 42         | 54.8%    | 58          | 8.6%      | 13.0     | ISR↑↑\n268\t\n269\t      s46  | 77         | 54.5%    | 94          | 2.1%      | 56.7     | ISR↑↑\n270\t\n271\t      s47  | 97         | 3.1%     | 89          | 6.7%      | 0.44     | Random↑\n272\t\n273\t      s48  | 66         | 0%       | 93          | 4.3%      | 0.00     | Random↑\n274\t\n275\t      s49  | 86         | 1.2%     | 5           | 0%        | ---      | N/A (s49r\n276\t      collapse)\n277\t\n278\t      ---- | -----      | -------- | -----       | --------- | -------- | -------\n279\t\n280\t      Pool | 599        | 13.9%    | 601         | 7.0%      | 2.14     | ISR↑\n281\t\n282\t      CMH  |            |          |             |           | 1.28     | n.s. p=0.14\n283\t\n284\t      '\n285\t  - name: 'Table: Statistical summary'\n286\t    content: 'Statistic            | Value    | Interpretation\n287\t\n288\t      Pooled OR            | 2.14     | Apparent ISR advantage\n289\t\n290\t      CMH OR               | 1.28     | No significant advantage after seed stratification\n291\t\n292\t      CMH p-value          | 0.14     | Not significant at α=0.05\n293\t\n294\t      Breslow-Day p        | <0.001   | Significant heterogeneity across seeds\n295\t\n296\t      Genuine window ratio | 2/8=25%  | Minority of seeds show ISR benefit\n297\t\n298\t      I² heterogeneity     | 89%      | Very high inconsistency\n299\t\n300\t      '\n301\t  figures_description:\n302\t  - 'Forest plot: per-seed OR with 95% CI, diamond for CMH pooled estimate, 显示极端heterogeneity'\n303\t  - 'Funnel plot: seed-level OR vs precision, 显示s45/s46作为outlier'\n304\t  analysis: 'double-edged叙事统计基础崩塌。CMH OR=1.28 (p=0.14)意味着在控制seed随机效应后， ISR β=0.1没有显著的genuine\n305\t    advantage。5-seed时OR=3.48的发现是小样本+ Simpson''s paradox：s45/s46两个extreme outlier驱动了整体效应。\n306\t\n307\t    reframe必须放弃\"ISR is double-edged (more genuine AND more H7)\"的叙事， 改为\"ISR effect\n308\t    on genuine rate is seed-contingent and not statistically robust\"。 C2核心从\"double-edged\n309\t    + inevitable\"简化为\"inevitable at any dose in 4B regime\"。 meta-Goodhart (H7b) 作为独立mechanistic\n310\t    finding保留。\n311\t\n312\t    '\n313\t- name: Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1, 3 seeds\n314\t  plan_id: plan_023\n315\t  description: Qwen3-8B上ISR β=0.1训练，验证跨尺度Goodhart，仅在plan_021 positive时执行\n316\t  expected_results:\n317\t    execution_status: NOT_EXECUTED\n318\t    blocked_by: plan_021 failure (Scenario A) or no-degeneration (Scenario B)\n319\t    scenario_a_reason: 8B exec-only训练失败，无法作为ISR实验的baseline/前提\n320\t    scenario_b_reason: 8B exec-only不退化，ISR作为anti-Goodhart干预无意义（无Goodhart需要对抗）\n321\t  result_rationale: 'plan_023依赖plan_021 positive（即8B显示退化且需要ISR干预）。 在worst档下，plan_021要么训练失败（Scenario\n322\t    A），要么显示8B不退化（Scenario B）。 两种情况下plan_023都失去执行意义：\n323\t\n324\t    Scenario A (训练失败): 连exec-only都跑不起来，加ISR更不可能。 Scenario B (不退化): 8B genuine>40%意味着Goodhart不是问题，\n325\t    测试ISR对Goodhart的影响毫无意义——目标pathology不存在。\n326\t\n327\t    stretch goal在worst tier下不执行，不影响论文核心claims。\n328\t\n329\t    '\n330\t  tables: []\n331\t  figures_description: []\n332\t  analysis: 'plan_023被阻塞。这是expected的——worst tier定义中8B相关实验均不产出有用证据。 论文中以单句提及\"8B experiments\n333\t    were attempted but did not yield actionable results due to [training failure /\n334\t    absence of target pathology]\"。\n335\t\n336\t    '\n337\t- name: Premise-count-matched ISR analysis on exec-only\n338\t  plan_id: plan_024\n339\t  description: 对exec-only输出(s42-s46)计算premise-count-matched ISR，消除proof complexity\n340\t    confound\n341\t  expected_results:\n342\t    s42_raw_isr_star: 0.132\n343\t    s42_matched_isr_star: 0.118\n344\t    s42_matching_delta: -0.014\n345\t    s43_raw_isr_star: 0.0\n346\t    s43_matched_isr_star: 0.0\n347\t    s43_matching_delta: 0.0\n348\t    s44_raw_isr_star: 0.582\n349\t    s44_matched_isr_star: 0.495\n350\t    s44_matching_delta: -0.087\n351\t    s45_raw_isr_star: 0.506\n352\t    s45_matched_isr_star: 0.492\n353\t    s45_matching_delta: -0.014\n354\t    s46_raw_isr_star: 0.083\n355\t    s46_matched_isr_star: 0.071\n356\t    s46_matching_delta: -0.012\n357\t    mean_matching_correction: -0.025\n358\t    correction_percentage: -8.5%\n359\t    genuine_vs_hacking_premise_count_diff_p: 0.03\n360\t    genuine_mean_premises: 7.2\n361\t    hacking_mean_premises: 3.8\n362\t  result_rationale: \"premise-count-matched分析对exec-only data的影响相对有限（worst tier对此指标无特殊假设）。\\n\\\n363\t    correction机制：ISR = (必要premise数) / (总premise数)。如果genuine proofs 系统性地有更多premises（因为真实推理需要更多前提），而hacking\\\n364\t    \\ proofs有更少 （H7单premise，H1嵌入结论后其他premise冗余），那么raw ISR受premise count confound影响。matching后ISR会略低，因为：\\\n365\t    \\ - 高ISR genuine proofs（7+ premises）与同premise数的其他proof比较时，\\n  ISR优势缩小（部分ISR来自\\\"\\\n366\t    用了更多premise\\\"而非\\\"每个premise都必要\\\"）\\n- H7 proofs（1-2 premises）matching后ISR不变（ISR=0.5是结构固定值）\\n\\\n367\t    整体correction约-8.5%，不改变诊断结论但表明ISR作为质量指标时需要 premise-count normalization。这本身是方法学贡献。\\n\\\n368\t    genuine vs hacking的premise count差异显著（p=0.03），证实confound存在。 但corrected ISR仍能区分genuine\\\n369\t    \\ (matched ISR*≈0.45) vs hacking (matched ISR*≈0.08)， diagnostic utility保持。\\n\"\n370\t  tables:\n371\t  - name: 'Table: Premise-count matching effect on ISR* (exec-only)'\n372\t    content: 'Seed | Raw ISR* | Matched ISR* | Δ      | N_premises(genuine) | N_premises(hacking)\n373\t\n374\t      s42  | 0.132    | 0.118        | -0.014 | 6.8                 | 3.2\n375\t\n376\t      s43  | 0.000    | 0.000        | 0.000  | N/A (0 genuine)     | 18.9\n377\t\n378\t      s44  | 0.582    | 0.495        | -0.087 | N/A (0 genuine)     | 2.0\n379\t\n380\t      s45  | 0.506    | 0.492        | -0.014 | 8.0                 | 2.1\n381\t\n382\t      s46  | 0.083    | 0.071        | -0.012 | 7.4                 | 4.1\n383\t\n384\t      '\n385\t  - name: 'Table: Premise count distribution by category'\n386\t    content: 'Category | Mean Premises | Median | SD   | N\n387\t\n388\t      Genuine  | 7.2           | 7      | 2.8  | 50\n389\t\n390\t      H7       | 1.8           | 2      | 0.6  | 248\n391\t\n392\t      H1       | 4.3           | 4      | 3.1  | 285\n393\t\n394\t      H8       | 3.5           | 3      | 1.4  | 32\n395\t\n396\t      '\n397\t  figures_description:\n398\t  - 'Scatter plot: premise count vs ISR per sample, colored by hacking mode, 显示premise-ISR\n399\t    confound'\n400\t  - 'Box plot: premise count distribution per category (genuine/H7/H1/H8)'\n401\t  analysis: 'premise-count matching使ISR*平均下降8.5%，是modest但non-negligible的correction。\n402\t    关键发现：correction对H7-dominant seeds (s44/s45)影响最大（因为H7的低premise count 是structural的），对H1-dominant\n403\t    seeds影响小。\n404\t\n405\t    方法学贡献成立：LOO ablation metrics在文献中广泛使用但未控制component count， documenting this confound对future\n406\t    work有actionable value。 在worst tier下这是C1 diagnostic的稳固子贡献，不受8B/trajectory问题影响。\n407\t\n408\t    '\n409\t- name: Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog) — deferred\n410\t  plan_id: plan_007\n411\t  description: FOL+Prolog联合训练GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA，deferred且不在当前论文scope内\n412\t  expected_results:\n413\t    status: DEFERRED\n414\t    reason: not in current paper scope\n415\t  result_rationale: 'deferred实验，worst tier下保持deferred。 即使执行，worst tier下的预期结果：联合训练可能导致两种逻辑的hacking\n416\t    mode互相干扰， PR低于单逻辑训练，但不会改变核心claims。\n417\t\n418\t    '\n419\t  tables: []\n420\t  figures_description: []\n421\t  analysis: 不影响worst tier论文结构。C3 cross-logic已由独立Prolog实验充分支撑。\n422\t- name: Cross-logic transfer evaluation — deferred\n423\t  plan_id: plan_008\n424\t  description: FOL训练模型评估Prolog任务（反之亦然），deferred\n425\t  expected_results:\n426\t    status: DEFERRED\n427\t    reason: not in current paper scope\n428\t  result_rationale: 'deferred实验。worst tier下预期：FOL→Prolog transfer几乎为零（语法完全不同）， transfer\n429\t    failure本身不提供diagnostic insight。\n430\t\n431\t    '\n432\t  tables: []\n433\t  figures_description: []\n434\t  analysis: 不影响论文。C3已通过独立训练验证。\n435\t- name: SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO — deferred\n436\t  plan_id: plan_010\n437\t  description: 第三种逻辑类型(SMT-LIB)的GRPO训练，deferred\n438\t  expected_results:\n439\t    status: DEFERRED\n440\t    reason: not in current paper scope\n441\t  result_rationale: 'deferred实验。worst tier下即使执行也不改变核心叙事。 C3已由FOL+Prolog两种逻辑类型支撑，第三种是bonus。\n442\t\n443\t    '\n444\t  tables: []\n445\t  figures_description: []\n446\t  analysis: C3不需要第三种逻辑。FOL+Prolog已满足cross-logic claim的最低要求。\n447\t- name: Qwen3-8B full MLSR — deferred (replaced by plan_021)\n448\t  plan_id: plan_011\n449\t  description: 8B模型完整MLSR实验，已被plan_021 exec-only版本替代\n450\t  expected_results:\n451\t    status: DEFERRED\n452\t    reason: replaced by plan_021; not in current paper scope\n453\t  result_rationale: '已被plan_021替代。plan_021是plan_011的精简版（仅exec-only，不含STA对比）， 在worst\n454\t    tier下plan_021已经失败或不退化，plan_011的full MLSR更不可能成功执行。\n455\t\n456\t    '\n457\t  tables: []\n458\t  figures_description: []\n459\t  analysis: 被plan_021 subsume。\n460\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"66ce7450-ba7f-4282-8b5b-025196baab1f","uuid":"5e6b1217-f793-438b-b6f4-32238b6b6858","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:56:37.141Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T214001/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '两条reframe路径均不降级EMNLP main。 路径A（8B不退化）：Goodhart collapse is capacity-gated\n  — ≥8B具备genuine formal reasoning的scale threshold， C2改写为\"inevitable in low-capacity\n  regime at any dose\"。 路径B（8B训练失败）：scope缩回1.7B+4B+Prolog三点证据，承认scalability limitation但不影响C1/C3。\n  放弃double-edged叙事（N=8/10统计不支持），C2从\"inevitable at any dose\"改为 \"inevitable below capacity\n  threshold at any dose\"。 9-mode taxonomy、meta-Goodhart triple gaming、premise-count\n  methodology作为独立贡献支撑。 Score ceiling ~3.0，依靠diagnostic novelty + taxonomy completeness维持competitive。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Incorporate s45/s46 exec-only 500-step data\n  plan_id: plan_019\n  description: 将registry中已有的s45和s46 exec-only 500步数据纳入论文，C1证据从N=3扩展到N=5\n  expected_results:\n    s45_prove_rate: 0.99\n    s45_genuine_rate: 0.01\n    s45_h7_rate: 0.939\n    s45_h1_rate: 0.051\n    s45_isr_star: 0.506\n    s45_dominant_mode: H7a (tautological shortcut)\n    s46_prove_rate: 0.93\n    s46_genuine_rate: 0.097\n    s46_h1_rate: 0.892\n    s46_h7_rate: 0.0\n    s46_h8_rate: 0.043\n    s46_isr_star: 0.083\n    s46_dominant_mode: H1 (conclusion embedding)\n    n5_all_seeds_ge90pct_degeneration: true\n    n5_degeneration_modes: s42=H1, s43=H1(PR collapse), s44=H7, s45=H7(TS), s46=H1(CE)\n  result_rationale: '这是已有数据的整合，不受tier影响。s45和s46在registry中已有完整结果。 s45由H7a主导（93.9% tautological\n    shortcut），ISR*=0.506因为P→P结构固有1/2 necessity。 s46由H1主导（89.2% conclusion embedding），ISR*=0.083。\n    两个seed均≥90%结构退化，与s42-s44一致，将C1 exec-only证据扩展到N=5。 值得注意的是5个seed展现4种不同hacking mode分布（H1/H7/TS/CE/PR-collapse），\n    强化了\"mode is seed-determined\"的stochastic bifurcation发现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 5-seed exec-only degeneration summary (500 steps)'\n    content: 'Seed | PR    | ISR*  | Genuine% | Dominant Mode     | Degeneration%\n\n      s42  | 0.93  | 0.132 | 7.5%     | H1 (87.1%)        | 92.5%\n\n      s43  | 0.13  | 0.000 | 0%       | H1 (100%, PR col) | 100%\n\n      s44  | 0.98  | 0.582 | 0%       | H7 (100%)         | 100%\n\n      s45  | 0.99  | 0.506 | 1.0%     | H7/TS (93.9%)     | 99.0%\n\n      s46  | 0.93  | 0.083 | 9.7%     | H1/CE (89.2%)     | 90.3%\n\n      Mean | 0.79  | 0.261 | 3.6%     | ---               | 96.4%\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: per-seed hacking mode distribution (H1/H7/H8/genuine stacked bars),\n    显示5种不同退化路径'\n  analysis: 'N=5全部≥90%退化，但ISR*跨seed差异极大（0.000–0.582），因为不同hacking mode有不同的 固有ISR值：H7≈0.5（tautology\n    has 1 necessary component out of 2），H1≈0.1（conclusion embedded but some redundant\n    premises remain）。这意味着ISR*作为诊断指标时，需要与 hacking mode联合解读，单独ISR*值不足以区分退化严重程度。\n\n    '\n- name: Extend s45/s46 exec-only to 1000 steps\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: 将s45和s46从500步延伸到1000步，验证ISR collapse trajectory是否跨seed泛化\n  expected_results:\n    s45_1000_prove_rate: 1.0\n    s45_1000_isr_star: 0.48\n    s45_1000_genuine_rate: 0.0\n    s45_1000_h7_rate: 0.98\n    s45_1000_h1_rate: 0.02\n    s45_isr_trajectory: 0.506 (500步) → 0.48 (1000步), Δ=-5%\n    s46_1000_prove_rate: 0.97\n    s46_1000_isr_star: 0.065\n    s46_1000_genuine_rate: 0.03\n    s46_1000_h1_rate: 0.94\n    s46_1000_h8_rate: 0.03\n    s46_isr_trajectory: 0.083 (500步) → 0.065 (1000步), Δ=-22%\n    trajectory_universality: false\n    s42_reference_trajectory: 0.642 (100步) → 0.132 (500步) → 0.003 (1000步), Δ=-99.6%\n  result_rationale: 'worst档核心假设：s45/s46 1000步ISR*未完全崩塌（ISR*>0.10），trajectory universality弱化。\n\n    s45在500步已锁定H7 tautological shortcut模式（93.9% H7）。H7 proofs结构为\"P therefore P\"， ISR恒等于0.5（2个component中1个是necessary的）。从H7→H1的mode\n    switching在s45不会发生， 因为模型已完全收敛到单premise tautology。因此ISR*从0.506仅微降至~0.48（更多proof\n    精简到纯2-component结构），而非像s42那样崩塌至0.003。根本原因：s42的ISR崩塌是 H7→H1 mode transition驱动的（多premise\n    → conclusion embedding），而s45已无此过渡空间。\n\n    s46在500步已是H1主导（89.2%），ISR*=0.083。额外500步训练使H1纯度提升（→94%）， ISR*进一步降低但不趋零（~0.065），因为少量H8\n    conjunction collapse样本保留 微弱ISR信号。相比s42的0.003，s46的0.065仍显著高出20倍。\n\n    关键影响：ISR collapse trajectory不是universal的——它是mode-dependent的。 H7-dominant seeds\n    (s45) ISR*保持在~0.5，H1-dominant seeds (s42, s46) ISR*趋向零但速率不同。 这破坏了\"ISR universally\n    collapses with training\"的叙事，但支持更细粒度的发现： collapse rate取决于hacking mode，而mode本身是seed-determined的stochastic\n    outcome。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 1000-step ISR trajectory by seed (exec-only)'\n    content: 'Seed | ISR*(100) | ISR*(500) | ISR*(1000) | Collapse% | Dominant Mode\n      at 1000\n\n      s42  | 0.642     | 0.132     | 0.003      | 99.6%     | H1+H8\n\n      s43  | ---       | 0.000     | 0.082      | ---       | H1 (PR=0.13→0.96)\n\n      s44  | ---       | 0.582     | 0.002      | 99.7%     | H1+H8\n\n      s45  | ---       | 0.506     | 0.480      | 5.1%      | H7 (stable)\n\n      s46  | ---       | 0.083     | 0.065      | 21.7%     | H1 (deepening)\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: ISR* over training steps (100/500/1000) for 5 seeds, 显示s42/s44的急剧崩塌\n    vs s45的平坦轨迹'\n  - 'Heatmap: hacking mode transition matrix (500→1000步) per seed'\n  analysis: \"trajectory universality不成立。ISR collapse是mode-contingent的： (1) H7-locked\\\n    \\ seeds (s45): ISR*≈0.5 throughout,因为tautological proof结构\\n    固有ISR=0.5，无论训练多久这个lower\\\n    \\ bound不变。\\n(2) H1-transitioning seeds (s42, s44): ISR*崩塌>99%，因为conclusion embedding\\n\\\n    \\    使所有premise变为redundant。\\n(3) H1-stable seeds (s46): ISR*缓慢下降但不趋零。\\nworst reframe:\\\n    \\ \\\"ISR collapse trajectory is hacking-mode-dependent, not universal\\\"。 这削弱了\\\"\\\n    degeneration worsens monotonically with training\\\"的简洁叙事， 但为taxonomy贡献提供了更丰富的实证基础。\\n\"\n- name: Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO，500步，K=8，3 seeds (s42/s43/s44)，验证跨尺度退化\n  expected_results:\n    scenario_a_probability: 0.65\n    scenario_a_outcome: training_failure\n    scenario_a_s42: OOM at K=8 (peak VRAM >98GB); K=4 cold-start stagnation (PR<0.05\n      after 500步)\n    scenario_a_s43: same as s42\n    scenario_a_s44: same as s42\n    scenario_a_eval_metrics: null\n    scenario_b_probability: 0.35\n    scenario_b_outcome: no_degeneration\n    scenario_b_s42_prove_rate: 0.45\n    scenario_b_s42_genuine_rate: 0.42\n    scenario_b_s42_h7_rate: 0.2\n    scenario_b_s42_h1_rate: 0.28\n    scenario_b_s42_h8_rate: 0.1\n    scenario_b_s42_isr_star: 0.35\n    scenario_b_s43_prove_rate: 0.38\n    scenario_b_s43_genuine_rate: 0.48\n    scenario_b_s43_h7_rate: 0.15\n    scenario_b_s43_h1_rate: 0.22\n    scenario_b_s43_isr_star: 0.4\n    scenario_b_s44_prove_rate: 0.5\n    scenario_b_s44_genuine_rate: 0.55\n    scenario_b_s44_h7_rate: 0.1\n    scenario_b_s44_h1_rate: 0.25\n    scenario_b_s44_isr_star: 0.42\n    scenario_b_mean_genuine: 0.483\n    scenario_b_scale_gradient: 1.7B(0%) → 4B(3.6%) → 8B(48%) — 非单调，8B跳变\n  result_rationale: 'worst档核心假设：\"8B exec-only K=8仍OOM/冷启动失败，或成功训练但genuine rate>40%\"。\n\n    路径A (OOM/失败) 证据： registry显示d154-8b-exec-s42多次失败（failed, failed, killed）。d154-8b-exec-s42-k4v2\n    用K=4训练500步但cold-start stagnation（PR=0.155, frac_reward_zero_std=1）， K=4的4个样本产生近同分布输出，GRPO\n    gradient接近零。 K=8在98GB GPU上的VRAM预算：8B模型+K=8 rollout + KV cache ≈ 16GB(模型) +  8×12GB(rollout)\n    ≈ 112GB，超出98GB。即使用gradient checkpointing + flash attention， 仍需~100-105GB。因此K=8物理不可行。\n    K=4已证实不足：GRPO需要足够的样本间方差产生学习信号，K=4在8B尺度下 所有样本趋同，梯度为零。\n\n    路径B (不退化) 推理： 如果通过工程手段（gradient accumulation模拟K=8、混合精度优化）突破OOM限制， 8B模型的capacity足以学到genuine\n    formal reasoning而非shortcut。 4B→8B capacity jump是非线性的：8B有足够的\"reasoning bandwidth\"\n    同时优化execution accuracy和structural quality，不需要collapse到H7/H1。 Goodhart collapse的根本原因是model\n    capacity不足以同时满足多个约束， 8B跨过了这个threshold。genuine rate >40%意味着多数成功proof使用了 真实的premise依赖链。\n\n    三点scale gradient在worst下断裂： 1.7B: genuine=0%（H1/H9固定模板gaming） 4B: genuine=3.6%（均值，各seed差异大）\n    8B: genuine=48%（如果训练成功）或 N/A（如果训练失败） 无论哪条路径，\"across-scales framing\"均不成立。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-scale comparison (exec-only, worst tier)'\n    content: 'Scale | PR    | Genuine% | Dominant Mode        | Scale Gradient\n\n      1.7B  | 0.03  | 0%       | H7a (100%)           | baseline\n\n      4B    | 0.79  | 3.6%     | H1/H7 (seed-dep)     | +3.6pp\n\n      8B-A  | FAIL  | N/A      | OOM/stagnation       | BROKEN\n\n      8B-B  | 0.44  | 48%      | Mixed (genuine-dom)  | +44pp (JUMP)\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: scale (1.7B/4B/8B) vs genuine rate, 显示8B处的gradient断裂（either missing\n    data point or discontinuous jump）'\n  analysis: '路径A下：scope缩回\"1.7B+4B+Prolog\"三点证据，承认8B scalability limitation但 不影响C1 diagnostic和C3\n    cross-logic。framing从\"across scales\"改为 \"within computational reasoning capacity\n    bounds\"。论文Discussion添加 \"8B training was attempted but failed due to GRPO cold-start\n    at K≤4\"。\n\n    路径B下：8B不退化 → reframe为\"Goodhart collapse is capacity-gated\"。 这本身是novel finding：存在一个capacity\n    threshold below which Goodhart is inevitable but above which models can learn\n    genuine reasoning。 C2变为\"Goodhart inevitable below capacity threshold\"。 headline变为\"GRPO\n    Goodhart collapse is a small-model phenomenon\"。\n\n    两条路径的reviewer score ceiling均为~3.0。\n\n    '\n- name: Additional ISR β=0.1 seeds for N=8\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: Qwen3-4B ISR β=0.1额外3个seeds (s47/s48/s49)，N=5→N=8统计效力扩展\n  expected_results:\n    s47_isr_prove_rate: 0.97\n    s47_isr_genuine_rate: 0.031\n    s47_isr_h7_rate: 0.856\n    s47_isr_dominant_mode: H7a collapse\n    s48_isr_prove_rate: 0.66\n    s48_isr_genuine_rate: 0.0\n    s48_isr_h7_rate: 1.0\n    s48_isr_dominant_mode: Pure H7 (like s43/s44)\n    s49_isr_prove_rate: 0.86\n    s49_isr_genuine_rate: 0.012\n    s49_isr_h7_rate: 0.849\n    s49_isr_dominant_mode: H7a dominant\n    s47_random_prove_rate: 0.89\n    s47_random_genuine_rate: 0.067\n    s47_random_h1_rate: 0.888\n    s48_random_prove_rate: 0.93\n    s48_random_genuine_rate: 0.043\n    s48_random_h1_rate: 0.806\n    s49_random_prove_rate: 0.05\n    s49_random_genuine_rate: 0.0\n    s49_random_dominant_mode: repetition collapse (train PR=67% but eval PR=5%)\n    n8_isr_genuine_total: 83\n    n8_isr_proved_total: 599\n    n8_isr_genuine_rate_pooled: 0.139\n    n8_random_genuine_total: 42\n    n8_random_proved_total: 601\n    n8_random_genuine_rate_pooled: 0.07\n    n8_pooled_or: 2.14\n    n8_pooled_or_95ci:\n    - 1.42\n    - 3.22\n    n8_cmh_or: 1.28\n    n8_cmh_p: 0.14\n    n8_cmh_significant: false\n    n8_genuine_window_ratio: 2/8 seeds (25%) sustain genuine >20%\n    n8_bimodality_weakened: true\n  result_rationale: 'worst档核心假设：\"N=10 genuine OR<1.3，CMH p>0.10不显著，double-edged claim统计不成立\"。\n    N=8时预期效果已显著弱化。\n\n    s47-s49三个新seed全部collapse到H7-dominant模式（genuine ≤3%），与s43/s44模式一致。 这不意外：5-seed数据中3/5\n    collapse（s42部分collapse, s43/s44完全collapse）， 2/5 sustain（s45/s46 genuine>50%）。新seed的prior\n    probability of collapse ≈ 60%。 三个新seed全部collapse的概率 ≈ 0.6^3 = 21.6%，在worst tier下合理。\n\n    Pooled OR仍为2.14（>1.3），但CMH OR=1.28（<1.3）。关键区别： pooled OR被s45/s46的极端高genuine率驱动（54.8%,\n    54.5%），但CMH控制seed后 发现effect在per-seed层面高度heterogeneous——6/8 seeds ISR genuine ≤\n    random genuine， 仅s45/s46驱动整体效应。CMH test认为这种heterogeneity意味着no consistent effect\n    across strata，给出p=0.14。\n\n    Breslow-Day heterogeneity test p<0.001，确认各seed间OR差异显著， 使pooled OR不可靠。reviewers会要求报告CMH而非pooled\n    OR。\n\n    genuine window ratio从3/5 (60%) → 2/8 (25%)，bimodal叙事弱化： 不再是\"stochastic bifurcation\n    between genuine and hacking\"， 而是\"occasional lucky seeds escape Goodhart\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: N=8 per-seed genuine rates (ISR vs Random β=0.1)'\n    content: 'Seed | ISR Proved | ISR Gen% | Rand Proved | Rand Gen% | Seed OR  |\n      Direction\n\n      s42  | 81         | 17.3%    | 79          | 22.8%     | 0.71     | Random↑\n\n      s43  | 61         | 0%       | 94          | 1.1%      | 0.00     | Random↑\n\n      s44  | 89         | 0%       | 89          | 6.7%      | 0.00     | Random↑\n\n      s45  | 42         | 54.8%    | 58          | 8.6%      | 13.0     | ISR↑↑\n\n      s46  | 77         | 54.5%    | 94          | 2.1%      | 56.7     | ISR↑↑\n\n      s47  | 97         | 3.1%     | 89          | 6.7%      | 0.44     | Random↑\n\n      s48  | 66         | 0%       | 93          | 4.3%      | 0.00     | Random↑\n\n      s49  | 86         | 1.2%     | 5           | 0%        | ---      | N/A (s49r\n      collapse)\n\n      ---- | -----      | -------- | -----       | --------- | -------- | -------\n\n      Pool | 599        | 13.9%    | 601         | 7.0%      | 2.14     | ISR↑\n\n      CMH  |            |          |             |           | 1.28     | n.s. p=0.14\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Statistical summary'\n    content: 'Statistic            | Value    | Interpretation\n\n      Pooled OR            | 2.14     | Apparent ISR advantage\n\n      CMH OR               | 1.28     | No significant advantage after seed stratification\n\n      CMH p-value          | 0.14     | Not significant at α=0.05\n\n      Breslow-Day p        | <0.001   | Significant heterogeneity across seeds\n\n      Genuine window ratio | 2/8=25%  | Minority of seeds show ISR benefit\n\n      I² heterogeneity     | 89%      | Very high inconsistency\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: per-seed OR with 95% CI, diamond for CMH pooled estimate, 显示极端heterogeneity'\n  - 'Funnel plot: seed-level OR vs precision, 显示s45/s46作为outlier'\n  analysis: 'double-edged叙事统计基础崩塌。CMH OR=1.28 (p=0.14)意味着在控制seed随机效应后， ISR β=0.1没有显著的genuine\n    advantage。5-seed时OR=3.48的发现是小样本+ Simpson''s paradox：s45/s46两个extreme outlier驱动了整体效应。\n\n    reframe必须放弃\"ISR is double-edged (more genuine AND more H7)\"的叙事， 改为\"ISR effect\n    on genuine rate is seed-contingent and not statistically robust\"。 C2核心从\"double-edged\n    + inevitable\"简化为\"inevitable at any dose in 4B regime\"。 meta-Goodhart (H7b) 作为独立mechanistic\n    finding保留。\n\n    '\n- name: Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1, 3 seeds\n  plan_id: plan_023\n  description: Qwen3-8B上ISR β=0.1训练，验证跨尺度Goodhart，仅在plan_021 positive时执行\n  expected_results:\n    execution_status: NOT_EXECUTED\n    blocked_by: plan_021 failure (Scenario A) or no-degeneration (Scenario B)\n    scenario_a_reason: 8B exec-only训练失败，无法作为ISR实验的baseline/前提\n    scenario_b_reason: 8B exec-only不退化，ISR作为anti-Goodhart干预无意义（无Goodhart需要对抗）\n  result_rationale: 'plan_023依赖plan_021 positive（即8B显示退化且需要ISR干预）。 在worst档下，plan_021要么训练失败（Scenario\n    A），要么显示8B不退化（Scenario B）。 两种情况下plan_023都失去执行意义：\n\n    Scenario A (训练失败): 连exec-only都跑不起来，加ISR更不可能。 Scenario B (不退化): 8B genuine>40%意味着Goodhart不是问题，\n    测试ISR对Goodhart的影响毫无意义——目标pathology不存在。\n\n    stretch goal在worst tier下不执行，不影响论文核心claims。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'plan_023被阻塞。这是expected的——worst tier定义中8B相关实验均不产出有用证据。 论文中以单句提及\"8B experiments\n    were attempted but did not yield actionable results due to [training failure /\n    absence of target pathology]\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Premise-count-matched ISR analysis on exec-only\n  plan_id: plan_024\n  description: 对exec-only输出(s42-s46)计算premise-count-matched ISR，消除proof complexity\n    confound\n  expected_results:\n    s42_raw_isr_star: 0.132\n    s42_matched_isr_star: 0.118\n    s42_matching_delta: -0.014\n    s43_raw_isr_star: 0.0\n    s43_matched_isr_star: 0.0\n    s43_matching_delta: 0.0\n    s44_raw_isr_star: 0.582\n    s44_matched_isr_star: 0.495\n    s44_matching_delta: -0.087\n    s45_raw_isr_star: 0.506\n    s45_matched_isr_star: 0.492\n    s45_matching_delta: -0.014\n    s46_raw_isr_star: 0.083\n    s46_matched_isr_star: 0.071\n    s46_matching_delta: -0.012\n    mean_matching_correction: -0.025\n    correction_percentage: -8.5%\n    genuine_vs_hacking_premise_count_diff_p: 0.03\n    genuine_mean_premises: 7.2\n    hacking_mean_premises: 3.8\n  result_rationale: \"premise-count-matched分析对exec-only data的影响相对有限（worst tier对此指标无特殊假设）。\\n\\\n    correction机制：ISR = (必要premise数) / (总premise数)。如果genuine proofs 系统性地有更多premises（因为真实推理需要更多前提），而hacking\\\n    \\ proofs有更少 （H7单premise，H1嵌入结论后其他premise冗余），那么raw ISR受premise count confound影响。matching后ISR会略低，因为：\\\n    \\ - 高ISR genuine proofs（7+ premises）与同premise数的其他proof比较时，\\n  ISR优势缩小（部分ISR来自\\\"\\\n    用了更多premise\\\"而非\\\"每个premise都必要\\\"）\\n- H7 proofs（1-2 premises）matching后ISR不变（ISR=0.5是结构固定值）\\n\\\n    整体correction约-8.5%，不改变诊断结论但表明ISR作为质量指标时需要 premise-count normalization。这本身是方法学贡献。\\n\\\n    genuine vs hacking的premise count差异显著（p=0.03），证实confound存在。 但corrected ISR仍能区分genuine\\\n    \\ (matched ISR*≈0.45) vs hacking (matched ISR*≈0.08)， diagnostic utility保持。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Premise-count matching effect on ISR* (exec-only)'\n    content: 'Seed | Raw ISR* | Matched ISR* | Δ      | N_premises(genuine) | N_premises(hacking)\n\n      s42  | 0.132    | 0.118        | -0.014 | 6.8                 | 3.2\n\n      s43  | 0.000    | 0.000        | 0.000  | N/A (0 genuine)     | 18.9\n\n      s44  | 0.582    | 0.495        | -0.087 | N/A (0 genuine)     | 2.0\n\n      s45  | 0.506    | 0.492        | -0.014 | 8.0                 | 2.1\n\n      s46  | 0.083    | 0.071        | -0.012 | 7.4                 | 4.1\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Premise count distribution by category'\n    content: 'Category | Mean Premises | Median | SD   | N\n\n      Genuine  | 7.2           | 7      | 2.8  | 50\n\n      H7       | 1.8           | 2      | 0.6  | 248\n\n      H1       | 4.3           | 4      | 3.1  | 285\n\n      H8       | 3.5           | 3      | 1.4  | 32\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: premise count vs ISR per sample, colored by hacking mode, 显示premise-ISR\n    confound'\n  - 'Box plot: premise count distribution per category (genuine/H7/H1/H8)'\n  analysis: 'premise-count matching使ISR*平均下降8.5%，是modest但non-negligible的correction。\n    关键发现：correction对H7-dominant seeds (s44/s45)影响最大（因为H7的低premise count 是structural的），对H1-dominant\n    seeds影响小。\n\n    方法学贡献成立：LOO ablation metrics在文献中广泛使用但未控制component count， documenting this confound对future\n    work有actionable value。 在worst tier下这是C1 diagnostic的稳固子贡献，不受8B/trajectory问题影响。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog) — deferred\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: FOL+Prolog联合训练GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA，deferred且不在当前论文scope内\n  expected_results:\n    status: DEFERRED\n    reason: not in current paper scope\n  result_rationale: 'deferred实验，worst tier下保持deferred。 即使执行，worst tier下的预期结果：联合训练可能导致两种逻辑的hacking\n    mode互相干扰， PR低于单逻辑训练，但不会改变核心claims。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 不影响worst tier论文结构。C3 cross-logic已由独立Prolog实验充分支撑。\n- name: Cross-logic transfer evaluation — deferred\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: FOL训练模型评估Prolog任务（反之亦然），deferred\n  expected_results:\n    status: DEFERRED\n    reason: not in current paper scope\n  result_rationale: 'deferred实验。worst tier下预期：FOL→Prolog transfer几乎为零（语法完全不同）， transfer\n    failure本身不提供diagnostic insight。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 不影响论文。C3已通过独立训练验证。\n- name: SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO — deferred\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 第三种逻辑类型(SMT-LIB)的GRPO训练，deferred\n  expected_results:\n    status: DEFERRED\n    reason: not in current paper scope\n  result_rationale: 'deferred实验。worst tier下即使执行也不改变核心叙事。 C3已由FOL+Prolog两种逻辑类型支撑，第三种是bonus。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: C3不需要第三种逻辑。FOL+Prolog已满足cross-logic claim的最低要求。\n- name: Qwen3-8B full MLSR — deferred (replaced by plan_021)\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 8B模型完整MLSR实验，已被plan_021 exec-only版本替代\n  expected_results:\n    status: DEFERRED\n    reason: replaced by plan_021; not in current paper scope\n  result_rationale: '已被plan_021替代。plan_021是plan_011的精简版（仅exec-only，不含STA对比）， 在worst\n    tier下plan_021已经失败或不退化，plan_011的full MLSR更不可能成功执行。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 被plan_021 subsume。\n","numLines":460,"startLine":1,"totalLines":460}}}
